,"forms":["ن","نـ","ـنـ","ـن"],"joins":true,"ex":{"w":"نان","v":"نانْ","r":"nān","m":"bread","a":"fcd938a0e05e"}},{"g":"و","name":"vāv","r":"v","ipa":"/v/","forms":["و","و","ـو","ـو"],"joins":false,"ex":{"w":"وقت","v":"وَقْتْ","r":"vaght","m":"time","a":"6f17f0bb0dda"}},{"g":"ه","name":"he","r":"h","ipa":"/h/","forms":["ه","هـ","ـهـ","ـه"],"joins":true,"ex":{"w":"هوا","v":"هَوا","r":"havā","m":"air; weather","a":"ad57c5081c6d"}},{"g":"ی","name":"ye","r":"y","ipa":"/j/","forms":["ی","یـ","ـیـ","ـی"],"joins":true,"ex":{"w":"یک","v":"یِکْ","r":"yek","m":"one","a":"a0272bbd8ef2"}}]},{"id":"vowels","title":"Vowels","note":"Short vowels are small marks that are usually left out; long vowels are written as letters.","cols":3,"cells":[{"g":"بَ","name":"zebar","r":"ba","ipa":"/bæ/","ex":{"w":"برف","v":"بَرْفْ","r":"barf","m":"snow","a":"1e0f4ef60c33"}},{"g":"بِ","name":"zir","r":"be","ipa":"/be/","ex":{"w":"برنج","v":"بِرِنْجْ","r":"berenj","m":"rice","a":"42e1fa68c8c1"}},{"g":"بُ","name":"pish","r":"bo","ipa":"/bo/","ex":{"w":"بز","v":"بُزْ","r":"boz","m":"goat","a":"e3a017517ea6"}},{"g":"آ / ا","name":"alef","r":"ā","ipa":"/ɒː/","ex":{"w":"آسمان","v":"آسِمانْ","r":"āsemān","m":"sky","a":"ae8e7ade83f8"}},{"g":"و","name":"vāv","r":"u","ipa":"/uː/","ex":{"w":"دوست","v":"دوسْتْ","r":"dust","m":"friend","a":"4fed18860a95"}},{"g":"ی","name":"ye","r":"i","ipa":"/iː/","ex":{"w":"ماهی","v":"ماهی","r":"māhi","m":"fish","a":"dd4f563e93ae"}}]}],"tips":["Persian is written and read from right to left, but numbers run left to right.","Seven letters never join the letter after them: ا د ذ ر ز ژ و. In دارو (dāru, medicine) all four letters stand apart.","Some sounds have several letters: t = ت ط, s = ث س ص, z = ذ ز ض ظ, h = ح ه, gh = غ ق. Learn the spelling with each word.","Short vowels (a, e, o) are usually not written: کتاب (ketāb, book) is just k-t-ā-b. Learn every word with its pronunciation.","A vowel at the start of a word sits on ا: اسب (asb, horse), ایران (irān). Long ā at the start is written آ: آب (āb, water).","Tanvin ـاً is read -an at the end of some words from Arabic: لطفاً (lotfan, please), حتماً (hatman, definitely)."]},"zh":{"name":"Pinyin","intro":"Pinyin writes the sounds of Mandarin Chinese in Latin letters. Each syllable is an initial (first sound), a final (end sound) and a tone.","sections":[{"id":"tones","title":"The four tones","note":"The tone changes the meaning: mā is mum, but mǎ is horse.","cols":5,"cells":[{"g":"mā","r":"high and level","ipa":"[ma˥]","say":"妈","ex":{"w":"妈","r":"mā","m":"mum"},"tone":1},{"g":"má","r":"rising, like 'huh?'","ipa":"[ma˧˥]","say":"麻","ex":{"w":"麻","r":"má","m":"hemp; numb"},"tone":2},{"g":"mǎ","r":"low, dipping","ipa":"[ma˨˩˦]","say":"马","ex":{"w":"马","r":"mǎ","m":"horse"},"tone":3},{"g":"mà","r":"falling, like 'No!'","ipa":"[ma˥˩]","say":"骂","ex":{"w":"骂","r":"mà","m":"to scold"},"tone":4},{"g":"ma","r":"light and short","ipa":"[ma]","say":"吗","ex":{"w":"吗","r":"ma","m":"makes a yes/no question"},"tone":5}]},{"id":"initials","title":"Initials (first sounds)","note":"Pairs like b and p differ only by a puff of air: b has none, p has a strong one.","cols":4,"cells":[{"g":"b","r":"like p in spy","ipa":"[p]","say":"玻","ex":{"w":"玻","r":"bō","m":"glass"}},{"g":"p","r":"like p in pie, with a puff","ipa":"[pʰ]","say":"坡","ex":{"w":"坡","r":"pō","m":"slope"}},{"g":"m","r":"like m in me","ipa":"[m]","say":"摸","ex":{"w":"摸","r":"mō","m":"to touch"}},{"g":"f","r":"like f in far","ipa":"[f]","say":"佛","ex":{"w":"佛","r":"fó","m":"Buddha"}},{"g":"d","r":"like t in stop","ipa":"[t]","say":"大","ex":{"w":"大","r":"dà","m":"big"}},{"g":"t","r":"like t in top, with a puff","ipa":"[tʰ]","say":"他","ex":{"w":"他","r":"tā","m":"he, him"}},{"g":"n","r":"like n in no","ipa":"[n]","say":"你","ex":{"w":"你","r":"nǐ","m":"you"}},{"g":"l","r":"like l in let","ipa":"[l]","say":"来","ex":{"w":"来","r":"lái","m":"to come"}},{"g":"g","r":"like k in sky","ipa":"[k]","say":"哥","ex":{"w":"哥","r":"gē","m":"older brother"}},{"g":"k","r":"like k in kite, with a puff","ipa":"[kʰ]","say":"课","ex":{"w":"课","r":"kè","m":"lesson, class"}},{"g":"h","r":"like h in hot, but raspy","ipa":"[x]","say":"喝","ex":{"w":"喝","r":"hē","m":"to drink"}},{"g":"j","r":"like j in jeep, tongue flat","ipa":"[tɕ]","say":"鸡","ex":{"w":"鸡","r":"jī","m":"chicken"}},{"g":"q","r":"like ch in cheese, with a puff","ipa":"[tɕʰ]","say":"七","ex":{"w":"七","r":"qī","m":"seven"}},{"g":"x","r":"like sh in she, lips spread","ipa":"[ɕ]","say":"西","ex":{"w":"西","r":"xī","m":"west"}},{"g":"zh","r":"like j in jam, tongue curled back","ipa":"[ʈʂ]","say":"知","ex":{"w":"知","r":"zhī","m":"to know"}},{"g":"ch","r":"like ch in church, tongue curled back","ipa":"[ʈʂʰ]","say":"吃","ex":{"w":"吃","r":"chī","m":"to eat"}},{"g":"sh","r":"like sh in shop, tongue curled back","ipa":"[ʂ]","say":"诗","ex":{"w":"诗","r":"shī","m":"poem"}},{"g":"r","r":"between r in run and s in pleasure","ipa":"[ʐ]","say":"日","ex":{"w":"日","r":"rì","m":"sun; day"}},{"g":"z","r":"like ds in beds","ipa":"[ts]","say":"字","ex":{"w":"字","r":"zì","m":"written character"}},{"g":"c","r":"like ts in cats, with a puff","ipa":"[tsʰ]","say":"词","ex":{"w":"词","r":"cí","m":"word"}},{"g":"s","r":"like s in sun","ipa":"[s]","say":"四","ex":{"w":"四","r":"sì","m":"four"}},{"g":"y","r":"like y in yes","ipa":"[j]","say":"一","ex":{"w":"一","r":"yī","m":"one"}},{"g":"w","r":"like w in way","ipa":"[w]","say":"五","ex":{"w":"五","r":"wǔ","m":"five"}}]},{"id":"finals","title":"Finals (end sounds)","note":"With no initial, finals that start with i, u or ü are spelled with y or w: yī, wǔ, yú.","cols":4,"cells":[{"g":"a","r":"like a in father","ipa":"[a]","say":"八","ex":{"w":"八","r":"bā","m":"eight"}},{"g":"o","r":"like o in more","ipa":"[o]","say":"破","ex":{"w":"破","r":"pò","m":"broken"}},{"g":"e","r":"like 'uh', lips spread","ipa":"[ɤ]","say":"饿","ex":{"w":"饿","r":"è","m":"hungry"}},{"g":"i","r":"like ee in see","ipa":"[i]","say":"米","ex":{"w":"米","r":"mǐ","m":"rice"}},{"g":"u","r":"like oo in food","ipa":"[u]","say":"书","ex":{"w":"书","r":"shū","m":"book"}},{"g":"ü","r":"ee with rounded lips","ipa":"[y]","say":"绿","ex":{"w":"绿","r":"lǜ","m":"green"}},{"g":"ai","r":"like eye","ipa":"[ai]","say":"爱","ex":{"w":"爱","r":"ài","m":"to love"}},{"g":"ei","r":"like ay in say","ipa":"[ei]","say":"黑","ex":{"w":"黑","r":"hēi","m":"black"}},{"g":"ao","r":"like ow in cow","ipa":"[au]","say":"猫","ex":{"w":"猫","r":"māo","m":"cat"}},{"g":"ou","r":"like o in go","ipa":"[ou]","say":"狗","ex":{"w":"狗","r":"gǒu","m":"dog"}},{"g":"an","r":"like an in fan","ipa":"[an]","say":"三","ex":{"w":"三","r":"sān","m":"three"}},{"g":"en","r":"like en in taken","ipa":"[ən]","say":"门","ex":{"w":"门","r":"mén","m":"door"}},{"g":"ang","r":"a in father + ng","ipa":"[ɑŋ]","say":"糖","ex":{"w":"糖","r":"táng","m":"sugar, sweets"}},{"g":"eng","r":"like ung in sung","ipa":"[əŋ]","say":"冷","ex":{"w":"冷","r":"lěng","m":"cold"}},{"g":"ong","r":"like oong, oo as in book","ipa":"[ʊŋ]","say":"红","ex":{"w":"红","r":"hóng","m":"red"}},{"g":"er","r":"like er in American 'her'","ipa":"[ɚ]","say":"二","ex":{"w":"二","r":"èr","m":"two"}},{"g":"ia","r":"like ya in yard","ipa":"[ja]","say":"家","ex":{"w":"家","r":"jiā","m":"home, family"}},{"g":"ie","r":"like ye in yes","ipa":"[jɛ]","say":"写","ex":{"w":"写","r":"xiě","m":"to write"}},{"g":"iao","r":"like yow in yowl","ipa":"[jau]","say":"小","ex":{"w":"小","r":"xiǎo","m":"small"}},{"g":"iu","r":"like yo in yoga","ipa":"[jou]","say":"六","ex":{"w":"六","r":"liù","m":"six"}},{"g":"ian","r":"like yen","ipa":"[jɛn]","say":"天","ex":{"w":"天","r":"tiān","m":"sky; day"}},{"g":"in","r":"like een in seen","ipa":"[in]","say":"心","ex":{"w":"心","r":"xīn","m":"heart"}},{"g":"iang","r":"y + ang (yahng)","ipa":"[jɑŋ]","say":"想","ex":{"w":"想","r":"xiǎng","m":"to want; to think"}},{"g":"ing","r":"like ing in sing","ipa":"[iŋ]","say":"听","ex":{"w":"听","r":"tīng","m":"to listen"}},{"g":"iong","r":"y + ong (yoong)","ipa":"[jʊŋ]","say":"熊","ex":{"w":"熊","r":"xióng","m":"bear"}},{"g":"ua","r":"like wah","ipa":"[wa]","say":"花","ex":{"w":"花","r":"huā","m":"flower"}},{"g":"uo","r":"like wo in wore","ipa":"[wo]","say":"火","ex":{"w":"火","r":"huǒ","m":"fire"}},{"g":"uai","r":"like why","ipa":"[wai]","say":"快","ex":{"w":"快","r":"kuài","m":"fast"}},{"g":"ui","r":"like way","ipa":"[wei]","say":"水","ex":{"w":"水","r":"shuǐ","m":"water"}},{"g":"uan","r":"w + an","ipa":"[wan]","say":"船","ex":{"w":"船","r":"chuán","m":"boat"}},{"g":"un","r":"like 'one'","ipa":"[wən]","say":"春","ex":{"w":"春","r":"chūn","m":"spring (season)"}},{"g":"uang","r":"w + ang (wahng)","ipa":"[wɑŋ]","say":"黄","ex":{"w":"黄","r":"huáng","m":"yellow"}},{"g":"üe","r":"ü + e as in yes","ipa":"[ɥɛ]","say":"学","ex":{"w":"学","r":"xué","m":"to study"}},{"g":"üan","r":"ü + en","ipa":"[ɥɛn]","say":"远","ex":{"w":"远","r":"yuǎn","m":"far"}},{"g":"ün","r":"ü + n","ipa":"[yn]","say":"云","ex":{"w":"云","r":"yún","m":"cloud"}}]}],"tips":["The tone mark goes on a if there is one, otherwise on o or e; in iu and ui it goes on the last vowel: liú, guì.","After j, q, x and y, ü is written u but still said ü: qù, xué, yú.","Two third tones in a row: the first one becomes rising, so nǐ hǎo sounds like ní hǎo.","不 bù changes to bú before a fourth tone: bú shì (is not), bú yào (don't).","The i in zhi, chi, shi, ri, zi, ci and si is not \"ee\": just hold the buzzing sound of the consonant.","b, d, g, j, zh and z are said without a puff of air; p, t, k, q, ch and c have a strong puff."]}}